{
  "title": "Zesty Smoky Peruvian Chicken Aji De Gallina",
  "description": "A smoky and comforting Peruvian dish featuring chicken in a creamy aji amarillo sauce, served with rice and boiled potatoes, this flexitarian friendly recipe is made in an iron teppan.",
