  "instructions": [
    "Heat the iron teppan over medium heat and add the melted score fat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped aji amarillo peppers and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken breast pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the heavy cream and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Simmer the sauce for 10 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve the chicken and sauce over cooked rice and boiled potatoes."
